          "_name": "features3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features3\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards Bg\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background2-1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#fffaf5\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\" mbr-cards=\"bootstrap\">\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/signal-2025-05-30-213203-5-491x655.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Regelmässige Hufbearbeitung</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Eine regelmässige Hufbearbeitung ist die Voraussetzung für gesunde Hufe und gesunde Bewegungsabläufe. Damit deinem Pferd noch schneller ein gutes Hufgefühl ermöglicht werden kann, lernst du bei mir, wie du zwischen den Terminen selbst die Raspel einsetzt.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"Hufbearbeitung.html\" class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">erfahre mehr</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/signal-2026-04-25-164146-491x368.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            Hufrehe</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            Die meisten Hufrehen sind stoffwechselbedingt. Entsprechend umfangreich ist eine erfolgreiche Genesung. Damit du dich nicht alleine fühlst und an der Situation&nbsp;verzweifelst, begleite ich dich durch diese Zeit.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://blog.pferdephysio-bodensee.com/kopfkarusell-hufrehe/\" class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">erfahre mehr</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/signal-2026-04-25-164752-491x367.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Beratung</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Du bist unsicher, ob die Hufe deines Pferdes gesund sind? Oder ob sie sich in die richtige Richtung entwickeln? Oder würdest du gerne auf barhuf umstellen, zweifelst aber daran, ob dein Pferd das packt? Bei deiner persönlichen Hufberatung kannst du mir all deine Fragen stellen.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://payhip.com/b/tcYnF\" class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">erfahre mehr<br></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-20230626-wa0001-1-400x533.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            aktive Pferdebesitzer</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Nimm die Hufbearbeitung deines Pferdes selbst in die Hand! <br>Lerne, worauf du bei den Hufen deines Pferdes achten musst und wie du sie selbst bearbeiten kannst.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"Selbstraspler.html\" class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            erfahre mehr</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
